set_datarec_path /mnt/usb/MIPI_Framos_Image/1080V3_D 16 4096 1024
Ack(to=220000): OK
exec_ips0 title . "" examples/cpp-client/IPS/set_parameters.ips
Ack(to=1000): OK
On.send_ips_message=='Finishied Initializing MIPI': exec_ips "title" . "" examples/cpp-client/IPS/start_grab.ips
Ack(to=1000): OK

